  "post_content": "<p>Fanzara se sumerge este fin de semana en la Edad Media con <a href=\"http://400fanzara.blogspot.com.es/\" target=\"_blank\">una feria que conmemora, entre otros actos, el 400 aniversario </a>de la repoblaci&oacute;n cristiana del pueblo y la expulsi&oacute;n de los moriscos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1595.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1596.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1596\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1597.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1598.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1599.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1600.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1601.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1602.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1603.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara/dsc_1605.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_1605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef